  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Liberia&apos;s WTO Accession - Liberia&apos;s WTOAccession</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Liberias WTO-anslutning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till utveckling av Liberias handelspolitiska kapacitet, genom    samarbete mellan Kommerskollegium i Sverige och Handels- och          Industriministeriet i Liberia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to development of Liberian trade-policy capacity, through     co-operation between Swedish Board of National Trade and the Ministry of Commerce and Industry in Liberia.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initial objective of the NBT support was to facilitate Liberia&#x2019;s WTO accession during 2013-2017. In 2015, the Embassy of Sweden, the Ministry of Commerce and Industry (MoCI) and Swedish National Board of Trade (NBT) agreed to revise the project objective to support Liberia to take advantage of its WTO membership.</narrative>
  </description>
